.Dd August 20, 2026
.Dt XWP 1
.Os WordProcess 1.0
.
.Sh NAME
.Nm xwp
.Nd graphical WordProcess frontend
.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Op Ar file.wp
.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
provides the GLFW/OpenGL frontend for WordProcess.
It uses the same native format, editing engine, menus, commands, configuration,
conversion interface, and scripting interface as
.Xr wp 1 .
It adds a graphical window, embedded default fonts, and pointer selection.
.
.Pp
Press and drag the primary pointer button to select text.
Window resize events reflow the display; closing the window follows the normal
quit path and prompts when a document set has unsaved changes.
.
.Sh OPTIONS
All options are identical to
.Xr wp 1 .
Run
.Nm
.Fl -help
for the complete list.
.
.Sh CONFIGURATION
The GUI settings dialog controls default window width and height, font size,
and paths for regular, italic, bold, and bold-italic fonts.
The built-in defaults use Fantasque Sans Mono.
Changing GUI settings reinitialises the screen.
.
.Sh FILES
See
.Xr wordprocess-config 5
for global files and directories.
.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr wp 1 ,
.Xr wordprocess 5 ,
.Xr wordprocess-config 5
.
